completed_at: "2026-09-19T00:13:36.349Z"
author: claude-code-agent
estimated_minutes: 180
acceptance_criteria: "settings.json, schema, session-state, and checkpoint writes use singleton-lock discipline; parallel pm config set loses zero updates under stress."
parent: pm-dj98
risk: high
confidence: high
resolution: "Reconcile settings snapshots inside the history lock; serialize session mutations; atomically publish schema seeds and immutable checkpoints without replacement, including through path aliases."
expected_result: "Independent edits survive, stale overlapping writes refuse safely, schema seeds and rollback evidence cannot be overwritten, and locks release after errors."
actual_result: "All 9039 source tests and exact 100/100/100/100 coverage pass; the final linked singleton group passes 25 cases, including real alias collisions and synchronized SDK processes. npm/Bun consumers and npx/bunx workflows pass."
